{
  "format": 1,
  "name": "residential_proximity_one_source",
  "spec": ["residential 5.1", "residential 5.3", "residential 15.1", "RS5"],
  "description": "Test 1 through the states: a 5 x 5 building map (tract size 1) with key 6 = (purpose 1 << 2) + 1 + 1 only at (2, 2). States 0 -> 13 -> 1 -> 14 -> 2 -> 15 -> 3 -> 11 build the three proximity maps; running state 13 creates the temporary grid and seeds it (0 at the key tract, 255 elsewhere), and running state 3 shuts it down (instance 0) and frees it. Proximity R$ is the Manhattan distance |x - 2| + |z - 2| ((0, 0) = 4, (4, 2) = 2, every cell listed); R$$ and R$$$ have no key 7 or 8, so they stay 255 everywhere: with RS5 the running distance d is 32-bit, so 255 + 1 does not wrap to 0 and the min keeps 255.",
  "steps": [
    {"op": "residential_env", "cells": [5, 5], "building_map": {"size": 1, "cells": [[2, 2, 6]]}},
    {"op": "residential_create"},
    {"op": "residential_init", "expect": true},
    {"op": "residential_expect", "state": {"state": 0, "temporary": false}},
    {"op": "residential_run_to", "state": 13, "steps": 1},
    {"op": "residential_expect", "state": {"temporary": false}},
    {"op": "residential_run_to", "state": 1, "steps": 1},
    {"op": "residential_expect", "state": {"temporary": true}},
    {"op": "residential_expect_grid", "grid": "temporary", "size": 1, "counts": [5, 5], "cells": [[2, 2, 0]], "others": 255},
    {"op": "residential_clear_events"},
    {"op": "residential_run_to", "state": 11, "steps": 5},
    {"op": "residential_expect", "state": {"temporary": false}},
    {"op": "residential_expect_events", "filter": {"event": "shutdown_grid"}, "events": [{"instance": 0}]},
    {"op": "residential_expect_grid", "grid": "proximity1", "size": 1, "counts": [5, 5], "instance": "0x49D5BC96", "cells": [
      [0, 0, 4], [0, 1, 3], [0, 2, 2], [0, 3, 3], [0, 4, 4],
      [1, 0, 3], [1, 1, 2], [1, 2, 1], [1, 3, 2], [1, 4, 3],
      [2, 0, 2], [2, 1, 1], [2, 2, 0], [2, 3, 1], [2, 4, 2],
      [3, 0, 3], [3, 1, 2], [3, 2, 1], [3, 3, 2], [3, 4, 3],
      [4, 0, 4], [4, 1, 3], [4, 2, 2], [4, 3, 3], [4, 4, 4]
    ]},
    {"op": "residential_expect_grid", "grid": "proximity2", "all": 255},
    {"op": "residential_expect_grid", "grid": "proximity3", "all": 255},
    {"op": "residential_call", "method": "get_proximity", "args": [1, 4, 2], "expect": 2},
    {"op": "residential_call", "method": "get_proximity", "args": [2, 2, 2], "expect": 255},
    {"op": "residential_call", "method": "get_proximity", "args": [0, 2, 2], "expect": null},
    {"op": "residential_call", "method": "get_proximity", "args": [4, 2, 2], "expect": null}
  ]
}
